      "content": "It sounds like the airborne particles from your neighbor's garden are a real issue, and your feelings of lightheadedness are a clear sign that you need to take action. You can install a high-efficiency particulate air (HEPA) filter system in your home, as these are designed to capture fine airborne substances. Additionally, using an air purifier with activated carbon filters can help neutralize strong odors. You might also consider sealing any potential gaps around windows and doors to keep the outside air out.",
