      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tips. i'm already looking at HEPA stuff. i just wonder if the carbon filter is actually enough though. the scent is so heavy and it feels less like \"plants\" and more like something chemical or synthetic. it's like it hits me all at once during the misting. do you think there are specific types of chemical neutralizers or even certain coatings i should use on my window seals to make sure nothing is leaking through at a microscopic level?",
