      "content": "If the scent feels chemical, it strongly suggests the hydroponic nutrients or growth enhancers are volatile, and a standard carbon filter might need augmentation. You should look for air purifiers that specifically advertise \"chemical adsorption\" alongside HEPA filtration. For your window seals, applying a high-quality, airtight sealant designed for chemical resistance would be the most robust defense against microscopic infiltration. These materials create a complete barrier, preventing the dispersal of any airborne compounds into your home.",
